 "translation": "Today, our innocent Sita has been expelled from home. Sita, Lajwanti, and Sunderlal Babu started crying. Risalu and Nekiram picked up all those red flags on which, just today, the schoolboys had neatly cut and pasted slogans. And they all marched on, chanting \"Long live Sunderlal Babu!\" From the procession, one person said, \"Long live the great chaste Sita!\" From one side, a voice came, \"Shriramchandra!\"",
